{"_id":"6a2ffa1e2204ffbc59e5a83f","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"J_u8yvrHEWKKmVsVgPN7L","description":"# Plotly\n\nPlotly is a Python library for creating interactive charts and dashboards. It produces web-based visualizations using JavaScript under the hood, with a Python API. Plotly Express provides a high-level interface for common chart types, while the `graph_objects` module offers full control. Plotly integrates with Dash for building full web dashboards.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Getting Started with Plotly in Python","url":"https://plotly.com/python/getting-started/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb51"},{"type":"official","title":"Plotly Python Graphing Library Fundamentals","url":"https://plotly.com/python/plotly-fundamentals/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb52"},{"type":"video","title":"Plotly Tutorial - Basics in 7 Minutes!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PqUaDvbczbI","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aeb53"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T13:11:58.300Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/J_u8yvrHEWKKmVsVgPN7L.md"}